WEBVTT

00:41:57.595 --> 00:42:01.084
CA: I'm also married
to an amazing extrovert.

00:42:01.108 --> 00:42:04.630
She's incredible in social settings.

00:42:04.654 --> 00:42:08.263
Our solution for the social side

00:42:08.287 --> 00:42:12.581
is that there's a type of
bring-the-guests-round that we both love,

00:42:12.605 --> 00:42:15.343
which is the kind of
the single-topic dinner.

00:42:15.367 --> 00:42:17.000
Like, I'm terrible at small talk,

00:42:17.024 --> 00:42:19.719
but if you have a dinner
where it's about one topic

00:42:19.743 --> 00:42:21.133
and you go around the table,

00:42:21.157 --> 00:42:24.380
people have a chance to say,
I don't know, what's top of their mind,

00:42:24.404 --> 00:42:27.140
what they're fearful about
in the world or hopeful about,

00:42:27.164 --> 00:42:30.113
or you're discussing some topic
that everyone's interested in.